t|mint]], chopped\n* 15 grams fresh [[Cookbook:Cilantro|coriander leaves]], chopped\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]] fresh [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]] root, [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 2 fresh green [[Cookbook:Chiles|chile peppers]], chopped\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Deciliter|deciliters]] natural (plain) [[Cookbook:Yogurt|yoghurt]]\n* 3 deciliters cultured [[Cookbook:Buttermilk|buttermilk]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] of [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], chopped\n\n==Procedure==\n# Add cumin seed to a [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|skillet]] over medium heat, and toast until fragrant. Don't let burn.\n# Grind the toasted cumin seeds with a [[Cookbook:Mortar and Pestle|mortar]]. \n# Grind the mint, coriander leaves, ginger, and chili peppers into a paste.\n#Add the yoghurt, buttermilk and salt and make sure everything gets mixed up well.\n#Add the onion and the ground cumin.\n\n[[Category:Indian recipes]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using yogurt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using buttermilk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cilantro]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using whole cumin]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mint]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Churri (Indian Yogurt Herb Sauce)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"4","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 teaspoon cumin seed","sourceText":"1 teaspoon cumin seed","amountText":"1 teaspoon cumin seed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"10 grams fresh mint, chopped","sourceText":"10 grams fresh mint, chopped","amountText":"10 grams fresh mint, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"15 grams fresh coriander leaves, chopped","sourceText":"15 grams fresh coriander leaves, chopped","amountText":"15 grams fresh coriande